WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.185 --> 00:00:02.600
(dramatic music)

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:07.600
- [Narrator] Another world,
another time, another age.

00:00:08.928 --> 00:00:13.827
Thra, a wondrous planet
circling three suns

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:18.590
and at its center, the Crystal of Truth,

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:22.653
the heart of Thra and
the source of all life.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:28.290
Since the land was young,
Aughra protected the crystal,

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:30.470
for she knew that the crystal

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:32.783
connected all the creatures of Thra.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:37.293
But closest to her
heart were the Gelfling.

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:41.863
Seven clans of Gelfling called Thra home.

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:47.840
From the proud Vapra in the
mountain city of Ha'rar,

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:50.650
the most cultured of the Gelfling

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:53.223
who rule over the seven clans.

00:00:56.660 --> 00:01:01.440
To the fierce Stonewood who
dwell in the Endless Forest

00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:04.823
renowned for their prowess in battle.

00:01:09.370 --> 00:01:14.370
And the gentle Grottan, who
live deep beneath the ground

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:18.643
in perfect harmony with all of Thra,

00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:22.253
forgotten by the world above.

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:27.060
For uncounted millennia, all

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:30.343
of Thra existed in perfect balance,

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:36.290
but then new beings came not of Thra,

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:40.600
the Skeksis. (ominous music)

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:44.380
They bewitched Aughra with
stories of the universe,

00:01:44.380 --> 00:01:48.480
and built her an Orrery
so that she might discover

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:51.603
the mysteries of the cosmos for herself.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:56.822
And so Aughra turned her eye to the stars.

00:01:56.822 --> 00:01:59.572
(dramatic music)

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:09.020
and entrusted the Crystal
of Truth to the Skeksis.

00:02:10.262 --> 00:02:13.012
(dramatic music)

00:02:13.961 --> 00:02:16.044
(grunts)

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:19.750
Almost 1000 trine have passed since

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:23.478
the Skeksis declared
themselves lords of Thra.

00:02:23.478 --> 00:02:26.448
(staff pounding the ground)

00:02:26.448 --> 00:02:28.660
(sighs)

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:32.560
Now, once again, the Skeksis gather

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:36.313
in secret, as another day dawns,

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:44.410
to steal life from the crystal
they have sworn to protect.

00:02:44.662 --> 00:02:49.662
(dramatic music)
(growling and sighing)

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:54.653
So they may replenish themselves,

00:02:55.590 --> 00:03:00.590
cheat death by harnessing
the power of their treasure,

00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:06.770
their prize, their prisoner, (sighs)

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:10.833
the Dark Crystal. (dramatic music)

